OL,3,GNEWSATeen sexually assaulted by cadet
OL,4,Aleader, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Army Cadets instructor accused of
OL,7,Fsexually assaulting a teenager and
OL,8,Fasking him for nude photos told the boy
OL,9,F"there's a bit of gay in everyone", a
OL,10,Fcourt has heard.
OL,12,FRylan Ray, who was a detachment
OL,13,Fcommander for the youth organisation in
OL,14,FPeterborough, is on trial accused of 25
OL,15,Fsexual offences, many of them involving
OL,16,Fchildren.
OL,18,FThe 26-year-old, of Westgate in the
OL,19,Fcity, denies the charges.
